  "title": "EFC Background No-Go Theorem: Why Background-Level Modification Cannot Suppress Structure Growth",
  "description": "Consolidation of three independent proofs that the EFC background coupling channel (β·T(a) modification to Friedmann equation) cannot suppress σ₈ and is observationally empty under CMB+BAO constraints. Establishes a structural boundary redirecting EFC to the perturbation sector.",
